	)
	(text "J9 (azimuth encoder, field-wired) is fed from 3V3_CM4 via F3\n(100 mA PTC, 60 V) with D23 (SMF5.0A) clamping the J9 side.\nReverse polarity, or a supply above ~6.4 V, makes D23 conduct and\ntrips F3, so it cannot reach 3V3_CM4. Residual: a 5 V miswire is\nnot clamped. Place F3 and D23 at J9. AS5600 draws ~7 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 112.522 150.495 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1435ea78-55ce-42d6-ab14-d593e0a3135d")
	)
	(text "Encoder Inputs"
