	)
	(text "U16 isolates A1 S2 TX from CM4 GPIO13 (ROBO_RX_MCU).\nA1 runs from the battery while the CM4 can be off (SW1 open,\nGLOBAL_EN power cycle). A1 TX idles at 3.3 V; via R45 alone it\nwould back-power the CM4 through GPIO13 (abs max VREF+0.5 V).\n74LVC1G17 Ioff: with 3V3_CM4 off, Y is high-Z and A takes 3.3 V.\nCM4 TX -> A1 RX needs none: A1 is always on when the CM4 is."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 202.692 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7af8d9e9-dad1-4333-adee-572b24a8eed3")
	)
	(text "EMC: run motor leads in shielded cable, shield\nclamped 360 deg to the enclosure at the gland\n(not to J11/J14). Clip-on CM ferrite per pair at\nentry; 100 nF brush caps at the motors. Keep\nmotor leads away from GNSS/encoder wiring."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 69.85 184.785 0)
		(effects
