		(uuid "9e250d5e-0632-4b07-b02f-ea2918db1f2e")
	)
	(text "J11 = Firgelli motor (elevation):\n1 BLUE  (+)\n2 BROWN (-)\nSwap to reverse, or\ninvert M1 in Motion Studio."
